<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Daelim wins $120 mln Philippine order.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Daelim wins $120 mln Philippine order.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daelim Engineering Co Ltd, an affiliate of South Korea's Daelim Industrial Co, has won a $120 million order from Petron Corp of the Philippines to expand refining facilities, a Daelim spokesman said.  </p>
<p>The spokesman said the expansion is due to be completed by December 1998.</p>
<p>Petron Corp is a subsidiary of the state-run Philippine National Oil Corp.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5645</p>
</text>
